1,051 likes, 352 comments - oddlyhorrifying on August 10, 2026: "Authorities in Fort Myers, Florida, arrested 48 year old David Charette Jr. after he was accused of torturing and killing kittens as a way of punishing his 14 year old daughter. Investigators say the teenager contacted emergency services after allegedly witnessing her father beat, drown and place her two month old kitten, Luna, in a clothes dryer. Luna survived and was taken to a local animal hospital for treatment.

The investigation also uncovered the alleged killings of two other kittens over the previous year. One was reportedly smothered with a bleach soaked rag, while another was allegedly burned with a blow dryer before both were buried in the backyard. Family members told investigators they had been too afraid to report the abuse because they feared retaliation. Charette was arrested on aggravated animal cruelty charges and held on a $100,000 bond, while the remaining cats were removed from the home.

@oddlyhorrifying posts the creepiest photos on instagram daily".

802 likes, 168 comments - oddlyhorrifying on August 8, 2026: "On March 11, 2011, Jayna Murray was murdered inside the Lululemon Athletica store in Bethesda, Maryland, after discovering stolen merchandise in coworker Brittany Norwood’s bag. Police said Norwood later lured Murray back into the closed store, where she launched a brutal attack before attempting to stage the scene as a violent robbery by an intruder.

Murray suffered 331 separate injuries, including numerous defensive wounds and severe blunt force trauma. Investigators quickly found inconsistencies in Norwood’s account, including evidence that she had staged her own restraint. Norwood was convicted of first degree murder in October 2011 after prosecutors argued that the prolonged attack demonstrated intent, and she was sentenced to life in prison without parole.

@oddlyhorrifying posts the creepiest photos on instagram daily".

26K likes, 973 comments - oddlyhorrifying on August 7, 2026: "James McGraw and his wife Kelly became an internet sensation in 2019 after a prank war between the couple took an unforgettable turn. After Kelly gave James a haircut he hated, he got revenge by tattooing an unflattering photo of her sleeping on a plane onto his thigh, even adding extra chins to make the image worse.

Kelly was furious when she first saw the tattoo, saying James had gone too far, but the bizarre prank soon had thousands of people laughing online. Although she eventually admitted that the tattoo was so terrible she could only laugh at it, she warned James to watch his back, leaving him worried about what revenge she might have planned next.

@oddlyhorrifying posts the creepiest photos on instagram daily".

332K likes, 392 comments - yash_boss_world_111 on August 8, 2026: "TOXIC -A Fairy Tale for Grown-Ups🎬
@thenameisyash @yash_boss_world_111
TOXIC is one of the most ambitious Indian films currently in production, directed by Geetu Mohandas and headlined by Rocking Star Yash. Set in the coastal landscapes of Goa between the 1940s and 1970s, the film explores a dark world shaped by crime, power struggles, survival, and human ambition. Blending period storytelling with large-scale action, TOXIC promises a visually stunning cinematic experience crafted for audiences across the globe. The project brings together Indian and international talent, including world-class action designers and visual effects artists, elevating its scale beyond conventional Indian cinema. Marketed as "A Fairy Tale for Grown-Ups," the film aims to deliver an intense narrative filled with emotion, mystery, and high-stakes drama. With its unique setting, global production values, and Yash's powerful screen presence, TOXIC has emerged as one of the most anticipated films in Indian cinema, generating excitement among fans and movie enthusiasts worldwide".

